        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9587-50, Solid Brass Rectangular Drop Pull Ring</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2\" by 1-1/2\" surface mounted Ring Pull is great for cabinet doors, furniture, or cabinet drawers--anywhere that a ring pull is desired. The Surface Mounted Drop Ring Pull must be mortised (door face cut out) 5/8\" into the doors face. The mortising can be done with a router or small wood chisel. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Larger <a href=\"/products/drop-ring-pull-surface-mounted-omnia-9587-60\"><b>Omnia 9587-60 Flush Ring Pull</a></b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Omnia  9587/50 Surface Mounted Flush Ring Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth:  1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection:  1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-74410-SM.jpg?v=1704354552\" width=\"600\" height=\"190\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- this finish chart is less Satin Nickel -- <p align=\"left\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-74426-SM.jpg?v=1704354551\" width=\"600\" height=\"190\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finish Chart\">\r\n</p> -->\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is being discontinued. Very limited quantities available.</b>\r\n</p>",
